# ── Step 3: File Browser (optional) ──────────────────────────────────
filebrowser.card = Step 3 — File Browser
filebrowser.desc = Installs File Browser on this server, so students can upload and download files from the browser. Requires a web server already running (installed in the previous step or beforehand). Optional; you can skip this step.
filebrowser.btn = 📁 Install File Browser
filebrowser.doususuarios.titulo = ✅ You're about to create TWO users. They are NOT the same.
filebrowser.doususuarios.corpo = 🔑 admin (below) → the File Browser SERVER account. Holds EVERY student's work.\n\n🧑‍🏫 director (inside Tao) → YOUR personal account to manage Tao (subjects, students). Created later, the first time you open Tao, by typing "director" as the username.\n\nThey can't be merged: they live in different places and do different things. Typing "admin" inside Tao, or "director" on the server, will NOT work.\n\nRule of thumb: "admin" is only typed HERE. "director" is only typed INSIDE Tao.
filebrowser.doususuarios.check = I've read this and understand that "admin" (File Browser server) and "director" (Tao management) are TWO separate, independent users — I need to create BOTH.
filebrowser.form.fbuser = File Browser admin username
filebrowser.form.fbpass = File Browser password (min. 12 characters)
filebrowser.faltan = ❌ Enter the File Browser username and password.
filebrowser.pass.curto = ❌ The File Browser password must be at least 12 characters long.
filebrowser.user.invalido = ❌ The username may only contain letters, digits, dot, dash or underscore (for example "admin"). This looks like a password: check you haven't swapped the two fields.
